Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made it to Venice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, we're going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, you have to get out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I don't need to\Ntell you this, Vista.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But getting to the you-know-what\Nis our first priority here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Securing it will cement our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The disc is in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The vast amount of water will\Nslow down the freezing in the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so there's no better time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay. Just get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your definition of\Nvictory needs some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.04,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Beating Ice Boy into\Nthe ground and getting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the hell out of Dodge\Nwith the disc in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,that's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.14,0:01:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a dip, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I'm willing to wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My ice migrates faster than you can\Ndoggie paddle to the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I shouldn't have driven\Nthe car into here after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard's ice attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're unbeatable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you're pushing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're drifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming out of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want you to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to fight out of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to fight out of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never got to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue to fight. We will\Nbe in our hearts of our souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting Gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're trying to use\Nthose vines as ropes, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want these vines to make it\Nall the way across to the banks,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need some\Nwarmer temperatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This Sub-Zero cold is too extreme\Nfor anything other than tundra grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who said anything about\Ngetting the vines to the bank?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Grass is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but I need more and more and\Nmore Unless you want to fight the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Big one, grow me some grass, grow like\Nyour life depends on it. You're no, I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you now too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't get enough\Nof the stuff to make it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to land. Nice going there,\Njournal it finally froze
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,disaster avoided
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That asshole, he made the frozen grass\Ninto a freaking ski, crafty dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who said you could use a snowboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be crazy to think this lunatic\Nwould let me off the hook that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this guy, white ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch off the deep breeze now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.22,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the ice is melting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The realm of ice is the realm of stasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold's piercing embrace\Nsettles all into inertia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:04:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice halts everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hence the reason my stand, white\Nice, is the paragon of perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It can still the fury of the sea,\Nand soon you'll feel its power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself up already! Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.78,0:05:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, go for the grass\Nthat's down in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That stuff you used as a board!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, fire with your right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it up, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it through your moronic skull already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're powerless against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you withdraw Golden Wind's ability, the\Ngrass turns back into ordinary car parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning we can turn around and shoot\Nthe pieces at you like shrapnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be alright for\Nthe time being, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The good news is, you\Nbought us a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our primary objective at this point\Nis getting what we need and escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be sure the bastard won't\Nfall for the same strategy twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So forget about him and go, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crack that lion open like\Na piñata and find the disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll snatch it up and get out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need is a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But will hiding be enough to\Nfool that Winter Wonder Freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good chance that plan will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if it doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know for sure is this\Nguy isn't messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to think\Nabout what'll happen if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,he catches up with\NBucciarati and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This deranged bastard needs to die, and\Nthere's no time like now! What the? Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll prove you're not as\Ninvincible as you think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're forced to cover yourself head\Nto toe in ice, how exactly do you breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the hiss of air coming\Nfrom the back of his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how he's breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Numbers one and two get into\Nposition to flank this drone zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rest, get ready to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That nut job's looking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, he's gonna do\Nthat ice thingy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the first thing on his\Nmind will be coming up for air.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he surfaces, I'll blast\Nthat blowhole with some bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready or not, here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, six bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We strike the moment he takes a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Numbers one and two are reporting that\Nthey can't find the breathing hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Howie's positioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,His head's angled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The opening's covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, this plan's a non-starter.\NLet's retreat. Pipe down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Break position and you\Ncan forget about treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, one and two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.54,0:08:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some balls attacking\Nmy forehead like that! Meester!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.64,0:08:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to shoot the fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What stupid idea are you concocting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he looked down! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, blast away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look sharp, we're gonna kill this! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One and done, it's time to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you figured out how I was\Nbreathing and aim for that, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.28,0:08:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sub-zero temperatures bring\Neverything in the area to a halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gases become liquids, and\Nliquids become solids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,See the suspended vapor now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bullet, Mista! That sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a ricocheting bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's White Ice's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Gently Weeps. Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd already created a\Nfrozen barrier of vapor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it takes a lot of\Nenergy to make it work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But it protects me from\Njust about anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,including your damn bolts and bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm protected by a barrier of stasis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have you to thank for\Nthat little trick, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonah's prediction was right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Endless charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I go after that\Nstupid disc from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not under benches or in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it wouldn't be in plain sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing around here\Nthat even resembles a disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering how eager\NMista was to get over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the hiding spot\Nmust be pretty close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A picture should give me a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:09:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Things just went from bad to worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista's at the end of his rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking responsibility for\Nthis and is risking his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just the mindset needed\Nto light your path in this darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is when things get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no doubt there will be sacrifices,\Nbut Misa and I have Determinazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the actual hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They stuck the thing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.14,0:10:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In a crevice of a statue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at point-blank range!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From right here, I should be able to\Ntake out his breathing vent and more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can get close enough\Nto bypass his barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista is desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole ordeal, he's prepared\Nto pay for it with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't simple grit\Nin the face of desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's saving us with determination!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:10:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not martyrdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our road to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A computer disk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's what you dubious\Nbastards were after all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A clear path to the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I have this, the boss can\Nsay goodbye to his secret identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left now is to capture Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I gotta do away with you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it, chuckle schmuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to put you\Nout of your misery! Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.42,0:11:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what it means\Nto have determination to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,forge your path through\Nthe darkness of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.82,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Guido Mista, arrested at 17\Non allegations of murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the extenuating\Ncircumstances surrounding the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,his self-defense plea was rejected and\Nhe was sentenced to 30 years in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was actually happy before this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista had always been able to see the bright\Nside of things, but for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he was truly scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, you're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one who did this? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your story on the news, and\NI believe it was self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, from what I've seen,\Nyou're a top-notch gunman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and your inner strength\Nis even more formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, a guy like yourself wouldn't\Nlast two years wasting away in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you pulled some strings on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me guess, you're a mafioso?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a great restaurante.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're enjoying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You should try the bruschetta if\Nyou still have some room in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Mi scozi. Si?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruschetta for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And the others too, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Four bruschettas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, make it five.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be the lone man out\Nnow, can I? I am coming up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting back to what I was\Nsaying, I'll do it. I actually
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,think we'd make an awesome\Nteam that's why I'm agreeing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To it but first order me a Dallas\Ntoo. Oh, and some Tarot a la.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,froggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are an odd one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:14:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be worse. I guess it all
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista came to realize that each and every\Nperson has their own unique destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And while youth tends to be a difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,period filled with\Nseemingly endless setbacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,one always travels down the\Npath they're destined to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There, the path is plain as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to follow\Nit to the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it there through the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the path to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you idiots just\Nrefuse to learn your lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Or were you not listening when I told\Nyou sub-zero temperatures freeze vapor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I were to take a frozen mass of\Nvapor and stuff it in my soup to melt down,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,then the vapor would return\Nto its original state.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And since that state's basically air,\NI'm like a diver with a scuba tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a breathing vent to\Ntake in oxygen. Huh? Look at the van!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy deflected all six of the bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to beat this bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have all that determination\Ngoing for you, right, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Say your goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My determination is unwavering, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't given me yours, I\Nwould have never discovered my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The enlightened path that led me to\Nshoot myself with my own bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.74,0:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood's congealed to my visor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.58,0:15:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The path through the murky\Ndarkness wasn't going to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,reveal itself by blasting\Nthrough that protective ice wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the easier route was to splash\Nblood all over your ugly mug!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.70,0:16:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the metal pole from earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, your bullet must have reshaped it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something warm and wet is\Ntrickling down my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A moment ago, you asked\Nif I had determinazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna show you what it's all\Nabout, but you gotta do the same for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see just how determined you are to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,be shot into the proverbial\Nhell frozen over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.98,0:16:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard's still upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's worse, he's trying\Nto shove me back even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This lunatic is gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Merida, I gotta hurry\Nand yank this thing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't survive another blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to have resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:16:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now buckle up, bullets, and hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over till it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,White ice, gently weeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pass out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fade away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've still got some\Nfight left in this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the way you got him good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, you may have Determinazione,\Nbut I've got even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Guido Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say, you dole\Nout some major damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.70,0:17:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kudos to you, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:18:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,However, losing all that blood\Nwas actually to my advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I froze the blood you forced out of\Nme and created my own icy support.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It keeps that pesky spike from sinking\Nfurther into my neck, so I'm good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't beat me that\Neasily, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have a final bullet in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's now in your skull! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It shines even brighter\Nthan the morning sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's shown us the way forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's put us on the\Npath toward tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've won because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT THE HELL?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally starting to realize\Nsomething about this Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a total rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But even so, when he says something will\Nhappen, it eventually comes to fruition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My determination was really Giorno's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.72,0:19:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It flooded my being without\Nme even realizing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he superseded\NBucciarati to become Capo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,like he was guiding my every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell does he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like obsessing over\Nit won't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, huh? We got the disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But could you please heal me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:20:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only able to do all that because I\Nknew you could fix me up after the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, before I bite the\Nbig one, heal me up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I should probably clarify.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind doesn't really fix things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It creates parts I can add to you,\Nso there'll be new body parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll imbue the bullets in you with life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,replacing your damaged\Nblood vessels and tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, just get started, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I'm not actually healing your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you're still gonna have\Na bit of residual pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you have to be so rough, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.78,0:20:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Ande!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you\Nthere's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down and take it\Nlike a mafioso. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,there's about 18 more to go, and you'll\Nhave to strip if you want this to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.30,0:20:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm picking up two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.16,0:20:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like there's anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:21:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My guess is you've found Mista and Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.06,0:21:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the lack of excitement\Nhas them longing for our return.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.59,0:21:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are! Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.38,0:21:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop doing it so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.34,0:21:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave my damn clothes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, why, uh, no, but, uh, there's\Nsomething in my eyes! Ah, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hard to see in\Nthis early morning light!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep after it, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so rough, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I close my eyes,\Nwake up feeling so horny,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get you out of\Nmy mind. Since you'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.98,0:21:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,all I see I would give\Nanything Just to make you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,understand me I don't\Ngive a damn about nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,else Freaking you is all
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need I need your pain
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you got my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.60,0:22:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you won't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my mind You
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.40,0:22:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Got my mind. I don't wanna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, you must not say you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Must not change. What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm gonna freak you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.26,0:22:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.24,0:22:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm gonna freak you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Risotto, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're coming to Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Bucciarati and his\Nmen will take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.14,0:23:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come what may, peace is at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.90,0:23:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joe, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.94,0:24:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
